    {
      "name": "places/ChIJESJovFT1aS4R5j6a1O3tay8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaTWRYWTRUalJEVDI5dk5HNUtMVzF6WW5sT1duYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "I love the ambience, it feels homey. Lack of hot beverage (only hot americano and some tea). Default drinks are sweet so if you are not sugar tooth, you can ask for less sugar. Various food options. Somehow difficult for car parking space.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
