      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaTWRYWTRUalJEVDI5dk5HNUtMVzF6WW5sT1duYxAB!2m1!1s0x2e69f554bc682211:0x2f6bededd49a3ee6"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJESJovFT1aS4R5j6a1O3tay8/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2paVlExSlpUbkpwWW5jMFlWWmhVbEZPYlVZeFJIYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 months ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "I visited at 11AM and ordered buttermilk chicken with rice and Korean sweet sour chicken with rice. The cashier informed me that the rice wasn’t ready yet and it would take around 10 minutes, which I agreed to.\n\nHowever, I was really disappointed when the food was served—the rice was extremely dry and not acceptable in quality. I raised the issue, and although the server offered to replace it, there was no apology at all, which should be a basic standard of service. The staff also seemed undertrained.\n\nOverall, it was not a pleasant experience, though the cafe is cute and feels homie!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "I visited at 11AM and ordered buttermilk chicken with rice and Korean sweet sour chicken with rice. The cashier informed me that the rice wasn’t ready yet and it would take around 10 minutes, which I agreed to.\n\nHowever, I was really disappointed when the food was served—the rice was extremely dry and not acceptable in quality. I raised the issue, and although the server offered to replace it, there was no apology at all, which should be a basic standard of service. The staff also seemed undertrained.\n\nOverall, it was not a pleasant experience, though the cafe is cute and feels homie!",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
