    {
      "name": "places/ChIJESJovFT1aS4R5j6a1O3tay8/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNkMThTbElBEAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "The first time i came to P8 Cafe it was such a great place with a unique atmosphere in there. I feel the service is great, they serve me very politely and warmly. Maybe it's a great place if you want to work remote because the environment does not crowd from the street.\n\nI didn't complain about the service and place it is really the best for me. But i'm getting a little upset about the beverages especially for the coffee based. For me that really likes coffee, i think they must calibrate the composition of the coffee based drink. I ordered a mocha latte but felt like only 10% of the coffee was inside the glasses, and there was too much water in it. Maybe if you don't like coffee too much it was right for you, but for me it's not.\n\nThe food was great and the hygiene was served,  i really enjoyed it when i ate the food.\n\n*PS: They give you complimentary cookie with every coffee you order (Great tasting cookie)",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "The first time i came to P8 Cafe it was such a great place with a unique atmosphere in there. I feel the service is great, they serve me very politely and warmly. Maybe it's a great place if you want to work remote because the environment does not crowd from the street.\n\nI didn't complain about the service and place it is really the best for me. But i'm getting a little upset about the beverages especially for the coffee based. For me that really likes coffee, i think they must calibrate the composition of the coffee based drink. I ordered a mocha latte but felt like only 10% of the coffee was inside the glasses, and there was too much water in it. Maybe if you don't like coffee too much it was right for you, but for me it's not.\n\nThe food was great and the hygiene was served,  i really enjoyed it when i ate the food.\n\n*PS: They give you complimentary cookie with every coffee you order (Great tasting cookie)",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
