    {
      "name": "places/ChIJESJovFT1aS4R5j6a1O3tay8/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURid3NYNGdRRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "More than a comfy spot to work, chill, chat or enjoy snack and coffee, P8 cafe has plenty of space and rooms to hold events like workshops or yoga sessions.\n\nI've been here twice to guide yoga classes. It has a very lovely ambience with great drink options served with delicious butter cookies 💕\n\nThe music is at nice volume, so it's easy to chat comfortably.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "More than a comfy spot to work, chill, chat or enjoy snack and coffee, P8 cafe has plenty of space and rooms to hold events like workshops or yoga sessions.\n\nI've been here twice to guide yoga classes. It has a very lovely ambience with great drink options served with delicious butter cookies 💕\n\nThe music is at nice volume, so it's easy to chat comfortably.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
